x-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理过程：浮选-去除果皮果肉-干发酵44小时-晾晒19天\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          主产季：8-11月；次产季：3-7月\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          本批次采收时间：2019.9\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          到港时间：2020.3\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：橙子，柠檬草，蜂蜜甜，圆润\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Orange, Lemongrass，Honeyed, Round\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           冲煮参数：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           中细的研磨度，粉水比1:14-1:15 （18g/270g），水温92-93，3次注水（40/130/100），总冲煮时间2分-2分半\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QsIA9kUXHKZdRI8OvImplKeDtxodLE8W6gSnESyribQuZbG5ia5zFeJsSSwukAae6LicDXHhGAhuv8w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           关于白山庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n          白山庄园位于慧兰省的圣阿道夫区域, 庄园创立于80年代，现在由第三代Rodrigo Sanchez负责，庄园主要种植粉波旁，瑰夏品种。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           白山是一个非常有实验探索精神的庄园，Rodrigo与妻子和一个太阳能科技应用团队一直不断的尝试不同的技术应用在处理加工，发酵，晾晒环节，同时他们也与欧洲的专做肥料的Yara团队一起针对庄园不同的地块与品种来应用不同的肥料来改善土壤。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           白山一年有两个产季，高峰期分别是6-7月与10-11月，也正式由于产季的分散，是的庄园在每次产季有足够的时间去做多种处理方式的批次。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n           部分内容参考：https://medium.com/ally-coffee/behind-the-scenes-at-finca-monteblanco-dc0e4ef20976\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          可进入小程序，选购更多咖啡～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width: 235px;height: 235px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
